&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The attached document packet is classified &lt;strong&gt;Level 4&lt;/strong&gt; to clearance code &lt;strong&gt;SN129893&lt;/strong&gt;. Please confirm you have these credentials before continuing. If you have received this document in error, &lt;strong&gt;do not continue&lt;/strong&gt;. Contact your local Records and Information Security Administration (RAISA) office immediately and report a misdirected Level 4 information packet. Failure to do so is punishable by termination and additional consequences.&lt;/p&gt;
