						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>Hello there!</span></h1> </div> <p>This page is filled with art that can be described as Good, Cursed, or Cool but you'll be the Judge so shall stumble in.</p> <div id="wiki-tabview-c9e25b0ef06cb9aa1859eb0c9cb097ae" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Padoru</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Characters</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>Pictures of the Varies Anomalies and or Events surrounding said anomalies.</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>- <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-662">SCP-662</a>/<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-113">SCP-113</a> - Mrs.Deeds</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/662"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/662/medium.jpg" alt="662" class="image" /></a><br /> Yes I know the stone is not here but please give me a better explanation, I'll wait</div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4795">SCP-4795</a> - Feathered F(r)iends-</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div cl